{%- comment -%}
  MUTO — rotating reviews in the buy box (muto-bf-review-box). A box in the dropdowns' style, between the buy box's
  three ticks and its Black Friday line, rotating through 20 real customer reviews from REVIEWS.io (energy,
  recovery, science, trust): stars, the review word for word (… marks where it is shortened), the reviewer's name as
  REVIEWS.io shows it, an age or town only where the reviewer gave one. Rotates every 6 seconds; pauses on hover,
  focus or tap; arrows to step; no auto-rotation for people who ask for reduced motion.
  Rendered by the custom-liquid section after the buy box (ag1_plans); a script moves it into place.
  Chosen 11 Nov 2026 from 103 reviews. A block of imported reviews (IDs 51870930–51870956) was left out pending a
  check that they are genuine; reviews about medical conditions were left out too.
{%- endcomment -%}
